{"id": "224505", "name": "נכון/לא נכון: אי-תלות X² והסימן של X עבור X נורמלי", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>נתון <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( X\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,{{CT:0}}) \\)</span>. נסמן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( Y=X^2 \\)</span> ונגדיר</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ Z=\\left\\{\\begin{array}{cc} -1 &amp; X \\leq 0 \\\\ 1 &amp; X&gt;0\\end{array}\\right. \\]</p><p>אזי <span dir=\"ltr\">\\( Y,\\, Z \\)</span> בלתי תלויים.</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">[[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">בדיקת אי-התלות</b><br>הצפיפות של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\sim\\mathcal{N}(0,{{CT:0}})\\)</span> זוגית, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(-X\\)</span> ו-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X\\)</span> שווי התפלגות; בפרט <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}[Z=1]=\\mathbb{P}[X>0]=\\frac12=\\mathbb{P}[Z=-1]\\)</span>. לכל <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\ge0\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\mathbb{P}[Y\\le y,\\ Z=1]=\\mathbb{P}[0\\lt X\\le\\sqrt y]=\\frac12\\,\\mathbb{P}[-\\sqrt y\\le X\\le\\sqrt y]=\\mathbb{P}[Z=1]\\,\\mathbb{P}[Y\\le y] \\]</p>ובאותו אופן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\mathbb{P}[Y\\le y,\\ Z=-1]=\\mathbb{P}[-\\sqrt y\\le X\\le 0]=\\mathbb{P}[Z=-1]\\,\\mathbb{P}[Y\\le y]\\)</span> (הנקודה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(X=0\\)</span> בהסתברות 0). עבור <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(y\\lt 0\\)</span> שני האגפים 0. לכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(Y,Z\\)</span> בלתי תלויים. לכן הטענה <b>נכונה</b>.</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "boolean", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": false, "showvalidation": 0, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["s", "ta", "tmp"], "nvariants": 5}